// Copy to Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in. Included last by Debug.xcconfig and
// Release.xcconfig, so it overrides their values.
//
// Values end up in the app's Info.plist, which anyone with the app can read: this keeps keys out of
// the repository, not out of the app. Secrets that must stay secret belong on a server.

// EXAMPLE_API_KEY = ...
